      "text": "\n$\\frac{2 n^2 h^2}{\\left(m_1+m_2\\right) r^2}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "nF8V3",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\left(m_1+m_2\\right) n^2 h^2}{2 m_1 m_2 r^2}$",
      "image": null,
