  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$r_1=\\frac{m_2 r}{m_1+m_2} ; r_2=\\frac{m_1 r}{m_1+m_2}$\n$\\left(l_1+l_2\\right) \\omega=\\frac{n h}{2 \\pi}=nh$\n$K . E=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(l_1+l_2\\right) \\omega^2=\\frac{n^2 h^2\\left(m_1+m_2\\right)}{2 m_1 m_2 r^2}$",
